Detonating a <strand/>Tangle morphs it into a spinning, seeking, damaging construct that roams the environment. 

Whirling <strand/>Tangles last for 12 seconds and continually seek targets, dealing damage to enemies in a 2 meter radius every 0.1 seconds.

Defeating enemies with a <strand/>Whirling Maelstrom releases <strand/>Unraveling projectiles.

Whirling Maelstrom counts as Tangle Hits and (inconsistently) counts as Ability Damage.

